    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰπᾰφίσκω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπατάω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				537
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήπᾰφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.379
				</span></i>
			; subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπάφω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.79
				</span></i>
			; part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπαφών, -οῦσα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				379
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				704
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aet.
				3.19
			</span></i>, etc.: <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> also has 3sg.
			aor. opt. 
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπάφοιτο</span> in act. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.376
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.160
			</span></i>: later aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπάφησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					376
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.137
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.94
			</span></i>.</div>
